exports[`the Reference tab’s examples > Chemistry: CuSO4 = @chem.substance({CuSO4*5H2O}) 1`] = `
"1: CuSO4*5H2O:\\quad M_CuSO4 = M_Cu+ M_S+ 9 M_O+ 10 M_H = 63.546 g/mol+ 32.06 g/mol+ 9\\times 15.999 g/mol+ 10\\times 1.008 g/mol = 249.68 \\fracg CuSO4*5H2Omol CuSO4*5H2O
     INFO CuSO4 is 1 mol of CuSO4*5H2O until its amount is set (CuSO4.n = …, or CuSO4.m = …). Its members: CuSO4.M, .n, .m, and each element's, as CuSO4.Cu.n, .m, .M and .w (its mass fraction).
