exports[`the Reference tab’s examples > Uncertainty: d = 3.50 m pm 0.02 m 2`] = `
"1: d = (3.50 ± 0.02) m
2: t = (1.21 ± 0.03) s
3: v = \\fracdt = \\frac3.50 m1.21 s = (2.89 ± 0.07) m/s
4: \\delta v = \\sqrt(\\frac\\partial v\\partial d \\delta d)^2 + (\\frac\\partial v\\partial t \\delta t)^2 = \\sqrt(\\frac1t \\delta d)^2 + [(-\\fracdt^2) \\delta t]^2 = \\sqrt(\\frac11.21 s\\times 0.02 m)^2 + ([-\\frac3.50 m(1.21 s)^2]\\times 0.03 s)^2 = 0.07 m/s
5: \\frac\\delta vv = \\frac0.07 m/s2.89 m/s = 0.03"
`;

